  "comparison": {
    "retail_iso": "the owner's v2.00 ISO (identity pinned in docs/inputs/slice118-volume-catalogue.json; not re-verified here)",
    "same_module_order": true,
    "identical_modules": []
  },
  "findings": [
    "Both images are romdir containers with the same 18 system modules in the same order.",
    "The runtime loads neither image: it answers the reboot RPC with a log line and serves the system libraries as native HLE, so no module of DNAS310.IMG has to be loaded for the HLE set to be complete.",
    "What the image selects is the FILEIO protocol generation through its own LOADFILE version (IOPRP300 3000, DNAS310 3100); the donor switched the asynchronous FILEIO server on only for a path containing 'IOPRP'."
  ]
}
